cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Federal Funds Rate and S&P 500 Market Performance: A Reproducible Data Curation Project"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Song
    given-names: Weimo
  - family-names: Dong
    given-names: Andy
abstract: "A reproducible IS 477 final project integrating Federal Funds Effective Rate data from FRED with S&P 500 market data from Yahoo Finance via yfinance. The project documents data acquisition, checksum verification, raw data quality profiling, data cleaning, temporal alignment, data integration, exploratory analysis, visualization, machine-readable metadata, and Snakemake workflow automation."
keywords:
  - Federal Funds Effective Rate
  - FRED
  - S&P 500
  - Yahoo Finance
  - yfinance
  - data curation
  - data integration
  - time series
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - metadata
  - Snakemake
